## Installing in Claude Code

By hand (this directory as a local plugin):

```bash
# inside Claude Code, in any project:
/plugin marketplace add /path/to/this/directory
/plugin install {{ meta.name }}@{{ meta.name }}
```

Or via git, if you push this generated directory to your own repo:

```bash
/plugin marketplace add https://github.com/<your-user>/{{ meta.name }}
/plugin install {{ meta.name }}@{{ meta.name }}
```

Rules (`rules/`) — like in most Claude Code plugins — aren't distributed
automatically by the plugin system. Copy the contents of `rules/` to
`~/.claude/rules/` by hand, or add that step to your own install script.

